# Environment variables for the Plant Pharmacy website.
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in real values:
#   cp .env.example .env.local
#
# Conventions:
# - `.env.local` holds real values and is ignored by Git. Never commit secrets.
# - This file is committed and must only ever contain placeholders.
# - Variables prefixed with `NEXT_PUBLIC_` are inlined into the browser bundle.
#   Only use that prefix for values that are safe to expose publicly.
# - Variables without the prefix are only available on the server.
#
# No variables are required by the application yet.

# --- Supabase (configured in Milestone 2; not used yet) ---
# Public project URL and anonymous (publishable) key. Safe for the browser.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key
#
# Privileged key. Server-only: must NEVER be given a NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix.
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your-service-role-key
